3\">布都御魂</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">角色造成的全伤害提高30%。爆发状态下命中敌人时使其陷入感电状态，受到的雷电元素伤害提高60.0%，持续7秒</p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 2;\"> <div data-part=\"gainMethod\" data-tmpl=\"general\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-general obc-tmpl__part--gainMethod obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>获取方式</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">补给获取</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">家园补给、精准补给、活动补给</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">置换空间</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">置换空间兑换（概率刷出）</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">大伟哥别墅</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">消耗大伟哥黑金卡兑换获得</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">作战凭证</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">第九期（V4.1）作战工坊限时兑换</p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div></div><div class=\"obc-tmpl obc-tmpl--col-l2r1\" data-data=\"%5B%7B%22tmplKey%22%3A%22general%22%2C%22partKey%22%3A%22material%22%2C%22data%22%3A%7B%22layout_%22%3A%22banner%22%2C%22list%22%3A%5B%7B%22level%22%3A%2235%22%2C%22material%22%3A%5B%7B%22name%22%3A%22%E4%B8%89%E5%88%86%E7%BB%93%E6%99%B6%22%2C%22count%22%3A3%2C%22url%22%3A%22%2Fbh3%2Fwiki%2Fcontent%2F1132%2Fdetail%22%7D%2C%7B%22name%22%3A%22%E6%B5%81%E4%BD%93%E5%90%88%E9%87%91%E5%9D%97%22%2C%22url%22%3A%22%2Fbh3%2Fwiki%2Fcontent%2F1890%2Fdetail%22%2C%22count%22%3A1%7D%2C%7B%22name%22%3A%22%E7%9B%B8%E8%BD%AC%E7%A7%BB%E9%95%9C%E9%9D%A2%22%2C%22count%22%3A3%2C%22url%22%3A%22%2Fbh3%2Fwiki%2Fcontent%2F1273%2Fdetail%22%7D%5D%7D%2C%7B%22level%22%3A%2240%22%2C%22material%22%3A%5B%7B%22name%22%3A%22%E4%B8%89%E5%88%86%E7%BB%93%E6%99%B6%22%2C%22url%22%3A%22%2Fbh3%2Fwiki%2Fcontent%2F1132%2Fdetail%22%2C%22count%22%3A3%7D%2C%7B%22name%22%3A%22%E6%B5%81%E4%BD%93%